pdbx_initial_refinement_model_accession_code_b3 procedural ERROR pdbx_initial_refinement_model conditional_accession_format_rule 'Invalid AlphaFold accession code format.' YES YES
pdbx_initial_refinement_model_accession_code_b4 procedural ERROR pdbx_initial_refinement_model conditional_accession_format_rule 'Invalid ModelArchive accession code format.' YES YES
pdbx_initial_refinement_model_integrative_source_name_b1 conditional_value ERROR pdbx_initial_refinement_model . 'Source name for integrative model type can be only PDB-Dev.' YES NO
atom_site_occupancy_over_one aggregate ERROR atom_site . 'Chain [{chain}] residue [{residue}] [{comp}] atom [{atom}] in model [{model}] has a total occupancy of [{total}].' YES YES
atom_site_occupancy_below conditional_value WARNING atom_site . 'Chain [{chain}] residue [{residue}] [{comp}] atom [{atom}] in model [{model}] has occupancy [{occupancy}] (below 0.1).' YES NO
atom_site_vs_entity_poly_seq procedural ERROR atom_site seq_model_mismatch "Residue ([{chain}] [{comp}] [{residue}]) does not match with the residue '[{sequence_comp}]' in sequence." YES YES
entity_poly_pdbx_seq_one_letter_code_poly_ala_b1 procedural WARNING entity_poly sequence_predicate 'We detected one or more chain(s) composed only of poly-ALA. If the residues have poorly defined side chains, they should be called by the register. If the register is unknown, the residues should be called UNK rather than ALA.' YES YES
entity_poly_pdbx_seq_one_letter_code_poly_ala_b2 format WARNING entity_poly . 'We detected one or more chain(s) containing stretches of poly-ALA. If the residues have poorly defined side chains, they should be called by the register.' YES NO
